=== the sentence for each failure, from the handler's own mapping ===
postgres: relation does not exist
  -> "Hub couldn't recreate this sprite. Reload its status before trying again."
provider: sprites API rejected the token
  -> "Hub couldn't recreate this sprite. Reload its status before trying again."
network: ECONNREFUSED
  -> "Hub couldn't recreate this sprite. Reload its status before trying again."
a thrown string
  -> "Hub couldn't recreate this sprite. Reload its status before trying again."
SpriteBusyError(1), same chunk
  -> "Recreating this sprite destroys it and ends its 1 running execution. Try again once it is idle."
SpriteBusyError(3), same chunk
  -> "Recreating this sprite destroys it and ends its 3 running executions. Try again once it is idle."
SpriteBusyError across the chunk boundary
  -> "Recreating this sprite destroys it and ends its 2 running executions. Try again once it is idle."
an unrelated error that happens to be named
  -> "Hub couldn't recreate this sprite. Reload its status before trying again."
